---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-black/10 bg-ink text-paper">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-12 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-end">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-black tracking-[0.2em] text-paper/50">FUKUOKA / TENJIN / CITY PLAZA</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">街の真ん中で、<br class="sm:hidden" />福岡の今日に出会う。</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-paper/[0.65]">{site.address}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm lg:justify-self-end">
      <a href="/access" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2.5 text-center hover:bg-white/10">アクセス</a>
      <a href="/guide" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2.5 text-center hover:bg-white/10">楽しみ方</a>
      <a href="/card" class="rounded-full bg-paper px-4 py-2.5 text-center font-bold text-ink">記念カード</a>
      <a href="/privacy" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2.5 text-center hover:bg-white/10">プライバシー</a>
      <a href="/credits" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2.5 text-center hover:bg-white/10">写真・情報出典</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="container-site flex flex-col gap-3 py-5 text-xs leading-6 text-paper/[0.45] md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} {site.name}</p>
      <p>本サイトは個人制作の非公式ガイドであり、福岡市・施設運営者・各店舗とは関係ありません。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
